# Danny Boy: words by Frederic Weatherly (1913), traditional Irish air ("Londonderry Air").
{title: Danny Boy}
{composer: Traditional (Irish air)}
{lyricist: Frederic Weatherly}
{key: G}
{tempo: 66}
{time: 4/4}
{x_level: 3}
